> - **Lead technician cannot be changed once a work order is Invoiced or Paid.** This is a product rule, not only a screen rule, so it must hold on every path that changes the lead technician — board drag, the lead technician dialog, Unassign, Undo, and the work order detail page. Production currently enforces this only in the interface; the underlying endpoints accept the change in Invoiced and Paid today. Implementing this rule server-side is in scope for Story 4. (2026-09-13)
